      "system": {
        "notes": {
         "player": "",
          "gm": "<p>Once per encounter, when the Succubus kills an Elite or Leader level enemy or Defeats a Player in Melee Combat, it may force all of its enemies within Long Range to make a Hard (-20) Discipline (Fear) Test. Any enemy that fails this test counts as being Frightened and suffers a -1SL penalty on all tests until the end of combat.</p>"
